<title>CANADA: CRICKET-SCOREBOARD FROM FIRST LIMITED OVERS INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOREBOARD FROM FIRST LIMITED OVERS INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard for the first</p>
<p>limited overs international between Pakistan and India played</p>
<p>on Monday at the Toronto Cricket, Skating and Curling Club</p>
<p>Ground in Toronto.</p>
<p>India won the toss.</p>
<p>(Match reduced to 33 overs)</p>
<p>Pakistan</p>
<p> Saeed Anwar c and b Kumble			   46</p>
<p> Aamir Sohail c Dravid b Srinath		    12</p>
<p> Ijaz Ahmed lbw Srinath				 35</p>
<p> Inzamam-ul-Haq c Kumble b Prasad		    5</p>
<p> Salim Malik c Joshi b Kumble			  3</p>
<p> Shahdab Kabir c Azharuddin b Kumble		 0</p>
<p> Wasim Akram run out				     9</p>
<p> Moin Khan c Tendulkar b Srinath		     2</p>
<p> Azhar Mahmood c Joshi b Prasad			6</p>
<p> Saqlain Mushtaq not out				22</p>
<p> Waqar Younis not out				    6</p>
<p>    Extras (13lb, 9w, 2nb)			    24</p>
<p>    Total (for nine wickets)			 170</p>
<p>From maximum 33 overs</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 44-1, 80-2, 91-3, 98-4, 108-5, 123-6,</p>
<p>131-7, 135-8, 148-9.</p>
<p>Bowling: Srinath 7-0-23-3 (1w, 1nb), Prasad 7-0-38-2</p>
<p>(1nb), Jadeja 4-0-30-0, Joshi 6-0-22-0 (1w), Kumble 7-0-32-3,</p>
<p>Tendulkar 2-0-12-0 (7w).</p>
<p>India</p>
<p> Nayan Mongia b Younis				  9</p>
<p> Sachin Tendulkar not out			    89</p>
<p> Rahul Dravid c Sohail b Malik		     39</p>
<p> Mohammad Azharuddin not out			 30</p>
<p>    Extras (2lb, 3w, 1nb)			     6</p>
<p>    Total (for two wickets)			 173</p>
<p>From 29.5 overs.</p>
<p>Fall of wicket: 18-1, 108-2.</p>
<p>Bowling: Younis 6-0-30-1, Akram 6.5-0-37-0 (1nb, 1w),</p>
<p>Mahmood 4-0-19-0 (2w), Sohail 3-0-25-0, Saqlain Mushtaq</p>
<p>6-0-39- 0, Malik 4-0-21-1.</p>
<p>India won by eight wickets.</p>
<p>Umpires: David Shepherd, Lloyd Barker.</p>
<p>India lead the five-match series 1-0.</p>
</text>
